We both get our parents off our backs.

7
00:00:25,057 --> 00:00:27,477
l don't have to come home
to an empty apartment.

8
00:00:27,684 --> 00:00:32,854
(Raj:)Plus, once I'm married, I can finally eat
carbs again and let myseIf go.

9
00:00:33,523 --> 00:00:37,573
(Howard:)Why don't you tell your parents
you wanna try to find someone else?

10
00:00:37,778 --> 00:00:40,568
